# GoaByte Builder Studio
#
# This file is intentionally empty, and that is the point.
#
# The application is a fully client-side image compositor. There is no server
# in the data path, no database, no auth, no API keys, and no upload endpoint.
# A user's photo is decoded, composited, and exported entirely in their browser
# and never crosses the network.
#
# See PRD NFR-021…NFR-024, NFR-037 and ARCHITECTURE §18.
#
# If a future feature requires a variable here, it requires a PRD amendment
# first — because anything that needs configuration probably needs a network
# call, and that is precisely what the privacy invariant forbids.
